Classes:
- Account class: Manages account details and transactions, has deposit and withdraw methods.
    - Holds transaction history ArrayList, each account gets their own history
- Account Manager class:
    - All accounts of type Account are stored in an ArrayList in this class
    - Searching algorithm for account by account number, name, or date of birth.
    - Create new account
    - Delete account
    - Edit account details



